  "title": "Fury Confirms Continuity and Extends Near Surface Gold Mineralization by 185 Metres at the Sakami Gold Project in Quebec - Fury Gold Mines Limited",
  "summary": "TORONTO, Canada – November 24, 2025 – Fury Gold Mines Limited (TSX and NYSE American: FURY) (“Fury” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce the assay results from the last four holes of its inaugural drill campaign at the Sakami gold project (“Sakami” or the “Project”) located in the Eeyou Istchee Territory in the James Bay region of Northern Quebec […]",
